From: JusDots <eng@jusdots.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:04:16 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 14/18] JusBrowse: segmented connect list - unified list
 styling

Every list in the app now uses the segmented-connected panel look:
each row is a Card with surfaceContainerLow + 0dp elevation, 2dp
seams between rows, large (28dp) outer corners and small (6dp)
inner corners per position. Generic SegmentedConnectList (Column)
and SegmentedConnectLazyColumn (LazyColumn) cover all Compose
lists; View.applySegmentedBackground + RecyclerView.applySegmentedDecoration
cover RecyclerView/Preference lists with one call.
